    "summary": "ImageMagick has a Heap Buffer Underwrite in the Floyd-Steinberg depth dithering method",
    "details": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to version 7.1.2-24, when using an image with mask the Floyd-Steinberg dithering method it will cause a negative heap buffer over-write. This issue has been patched in version 7.1.2-24.",
    "severity": [
